==LiteX build instructions==

./boards/targets/lattice_versa_ecp5.py --cpu-type vexriscv --cpu-variant linux --bus-standard axi-lite --log-filename log.txt --build --load

or

 python3 -m boards.targets.lattice_versa_ecp5 --cpu-type vexriscv --cpu-variant linux --bus-standard axi-lite --log-filename log.txt --build --load

Working on:

 python3 -m boards.targets.colognechip_gatemate_evb --toolchain peppercorn --cpu-type vexriscv --cpu-variant linux --bus-standard axi-lite --log-filename log.txt --build --load

 python3 -m boards.targets.olimex_gatemate_a1_evb --toolchain peppercorn --cpu-type vexriscv --cpu-variant linux --bus-standard axi-lite --log-filename log.txt --build --load

==Register Map (CSR)==
Check build/lattice_versa_ecp5/csr.csv

==Instantiation of verilog cores==
Example:
 cd gateware/traffic_generator_gmii
 python3 -m litex.tools.litex_read_verilog traffic_generator_gmii.v
        # # #

        self.specials += Instance("traffic_generator_gmii",
            i_clk=self.clk,
            i_resetn=self.resetn,
            o_gmii_d=self.gmii_d,
 ...
